{"parse": {"title": "NS-06", "pageid": 25785, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/NS-05\" title=\"NS-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">NS-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/NS-07\" title=\"NS-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">NS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.BB.84.E6.B2.99.E9.81.93\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"黄沙道\">黄沙道</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 黄沙道</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Yellow Sand Road</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>足<span class=\"color-value\"></span>底<span class=\"color-value\"></span>滚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>烫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>喉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>头<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>凉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>跋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>涉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>同<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>片<span class=\"color-value\"></span>未<span class=\"color-value\"></span>知<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1610106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两足在与四足的追逐战中，一开始就落了下风。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Cg-1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Cg-1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Cg-1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_mazhuisuigetian1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不必负重的斑纹马在草原上狂奔，巨鸟也在更远的空中逐渐缩小成一个断续变化的点。 早已疲倦的两人很快就因体力不支而被甩在后方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……呼……哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>别斯米尔……女士……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>力气比先前在平原上时更快地从周身溜走。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人的行动愈发艰难，脚步也逐渐停滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>我们是向着河水上游跑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-619912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-619912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-619912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>如果是上游，那么他要带猎物回到栖息地……难道、难道上游有森林？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>对不起，女士，我的脑子——转不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我的眼前……只有重影，什么也……看不清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩突然发现，自己再也拉不动年长者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一泄力，突然的停顿只让她陷入迷惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>唔……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>您为什么……呃……为什么停下了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>呼，呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>马的声音，就在前面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……还有许多人的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不仅是单纯的人声。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_chengmenqian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_chengmenqian\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_chengmenqian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-1_6_bg_chengmenqian.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_chengmenqian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-1_6_bg_chengmenqian.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_chengmenqian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-1_6_bg_chengmenqian.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_chengmenqian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>市集的吵嚷，旋律的铮鸣，马车负重，滚轮碾地，土石上的踢踏声随之而来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无论那上面究竟是什么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>——不。上游不是森林。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>这些墙、这些人……我、我不明白，等等……难道是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——土石组成的坚硬城墙和结构前所未见的高耸门楼，将人影绰绰的热闹城镇囊括其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大门洞开，行人往来，身着银盔的守卫伫立在城门的入口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……呃，这里是……补给站？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……不，不是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我们——我们究竟在哪儿？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>孩子，现在我需要你告诉我，我们大概走到什么地方了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>我听不到沙蓬翻滚，但有一些其他的声响。我在想，我们是不是走到有人聚居的地方了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩晃了晃脑袋，没有马上回答别斯米尔的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从未见过，也因此对眼前的一切产生怀疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>不是……至少，它看起来不像。它看起来不像任何我们见过的，那些城镇、村庄……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我，我觉得我出现了幻觉。我看到——荒漠植被和黄色的城墙，还有城墙上木头做的阁楼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>阁楼的屋顶就像鸟的翅膀，城墙下面的那些人看上去也不一样——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>有城墙，也有人，是吗？那么城墙之后，就应该是城镇，这与我听到的人声环境一致，也许并不是你的幻觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>不，请听我说，不是那样的。那些黄色的城墙和门，看上去根本不像真的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我从来没见过这样的建筑，在土石城墙上建起阁楼，四角就像飞在半空里一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>听起来，也可能只是另一种文明的建筑方式。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>而且，就算这是城镇，我们也不可能走了那么远。除非——除非这是假的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我们不能贸然过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>但是，甚至早在前头的人声出现之前，我们就已经跟丢了那个巨鸟和尤利恩先生他们，只知道扇动翅膀的声音，最后出现在正南方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩紧紧抓住了年长者的衣袖，她发觉事情正在滑向自己完全无法控制的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>而你眼前的城墙就在正南方，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>别斯米尔安静地以面庞朝向小叶尼塞。即使对方知道那被布料遮住的眼睛看不清任何东西，这个动作也具备了凝视应有的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那种安抚、稳定，却同时代表了执着叩问的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>您……您总是这样。您一定不会听我的意见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>孩子，我们已经在这里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>并且尤利恩先生他们，极有可能是因为我们的选择，才遭受了这样的灾难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小叶尼塞沉默了。片刻后，她做出了一个决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……城门的确开着，能看到里面的人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>可门口有守卫，拿着一些矛一样的冷兵器。最前面的那个人看起来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>和我们很不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>即使我们想进去，他们也不一定能听懂我们说的话……还记得那些牧民吗？没有来自当地的翻译，通常很难沟通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……那就希望我们的“通关文书”能派上用场吧。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "NS-06"}}